        text: "| Command | jq 'match(\"foo (?<bar123>bar)? foo\"; \"ig\")' |\n| --- |\n| Input | \"foo bar foo foo foo\" |\n| Output | {\"offset\": 0, \"length\": 11, \"string\": \"foo bar foo\", \"captures\": [{\"offset\": 4, \"length\": 3, \"string\": \"bar\", \"name\": \"bar123\"}]} |\n|  | {\"offset\": 12, \"length\": 8, \"string\": \"foo foo\", \"captures\": [{\"offset\": -1, \"length\": 0, \"string\": null, \"name\": \"bar123\"}]} |\n| [Run](https://play.jqlang.org/?q=match%28%22foo%20%28%3F%3Cbar123%3Ebar%29%3F%20foo%22%3B%20%22ig%22%29&j=%22foo%20bar%20foo%20foo%20%20foo%22) |  |"
